Adapted: starting values (frame counts, easing curves, floors) for the motions in
assets/html/moments.js — the one-frame press and the solid flip, the floor for unchosen
options, the one-frame "become" cut and its travel curve, the title demotion, the slot
and reel beats, the lead word, the marker stroke, the scan lag, the bracket bite, the
contact shadow, the list drift and the strip-away. The code, its API and the two
techniques built on the film's own material (the real-state morph and the keyword
that performs on the voice's word clock) are this project's own. No video-shotcraft
source file, template, recipe card or text is included.

